menu "Blinky (this app)"

config BLINKY_DELAY_LOOPS
    int "number of loop delays between each LED toggle"
    default 500000
    help
        Delay busy-loop (no real SysTick/NEON_Delay - see comment in Src/main.c) - value level to LED jump
        CHAM more, decrease to jump FASTer. read through CONFIG_BLINKY_DELAY_LOOPS in Src/main.c.

        Full menuconfig combined: this option is Blinky's own app (not belonging to SDK), appears in the
        same 1 menu as SDK options (components/driver) - see neon-mdf/Kconfig + cmake/kconfig.cmake.

endmenu
